Package: pistomp-wifi
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: pistomp <pistomp@example.com>
Description: WiFi driver configuration for pi-Stomp
 Ships /etc/modprobe.d/rpi-brcmfmac.conf, shadowing the distro's
 firmware-nonfree default (roamoff=1) with roamoff=0. On AP/band-steering
 meshes the firmware roam path keeps the link stable; the distro default
 caused wpa_supplicant to re-associate every ~12 min, restarting DHCP and
 dropping the link as seen from the network.
